    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Overview</h2>Overplasma is a combat, platforming and exploration game in alien worlds where you must face challenging enemies and obstacles as a space explorer who was in the wrong place at the wrong time!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132480/extras/2fcf86ddfe635089345bd2f5cc6e0546.avif?t=1696184587\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Skill based combat with diverse moveset<br></li><li>Non linear world<br></li><li>Unlockable skills and power ups<br></li><li>Over 25 types of enemies<br></li><li>Adjustable difficult setting (Changes A.I and environment)<br></li><li>Colorful alien world<br></li><li>Secret areas<br></li><li>Different endings<br></li><li>Simple but hard to master combat</li></ul>",
